  repeatable: 1
  audioProfileName: 
  dialogNodes:
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'Good day my Lady! Art thou new to the area? '
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: Yes ..
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: Well then, why didn't you say so! Would you like to know more about
      our pride and joy, Uniwia?
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c776d2d2c14fc643bfeae297272df2f, type: 3}
    nextOption: Yes please!
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'This castle was first built by command of constable Bambis the
      1st, in order to fortify his clan from the evil wizard who shall not be named..


      The
      evil wizard was defeated in the war of Antikeemenostrafees, though legend says
      his spirit still lurks around the city, searching for new victims..'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: 
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: "Late at night, in the guise of a decripit fellow, he seeks the
      inauspicious folk. \n\nAnd once he utters his riddles, I am afraid it is already
      too late..\n\nIf the answer does not satisfy him, he executes his victim, right
      there and then!\n"
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: 
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: '



      And then, he disappears again, into the night..'
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 68d33a33fc008d44ea3ebcafcb8f35b9, type: 3}
    nextOption: 
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: "Anyhow, do not worry about it, its just what old folk say to scare
      unruly children. \n\nIt is just a tale, nothing more to it...\n\n\n\n...i think"
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: 
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: "God be with ye! \n"
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: 
  prerequisiteConditions: []
